WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:06.800 align:start position:19%
Every October, something impossible
happens on the Mekong River. Glowing red

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:11.080 align:start position:19%
fireballs rise from the water, float up
into the night sky, and vanish.

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:14.400 align:start position:19%
Hundreds of them. Thousands of people
gather to watch.

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:17.800 align:start position:19%
Locals say it is the Naga, a giant
serpent god waking up.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:21.280 align:start position:19%
Scientists have a different theory.
Bubbles of natural gas rising from the

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:24.400 align:start position:19%
river bed, catching fire as they
surface.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:27.680 align:start position:19%
But here's the mystery. Why do they only
appear in October?

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:31.320 align:start position:19%
The river keeps its secret. Hit
subscribe for more strange tales.

